{"at": "2026-09-03T20:41:08.108809+00:00", "event_id": "01M1MG1ZRC6HYQ7786KYFQ111D", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M1MFXSJHAYEFYCDCC5NKS8JT", "final_answer": "Structural single source: a shared pure-ESM core imported by both the bare-Node gate (validate-frontmatter.mjs) and the toolkit libs (sections.ts loadVocabulary, metadata.ts expectedDocType), so vocabulary + type-derivation divergence is impossible by construction. The NFR-004 resolved-vocabulary parity test becomes a redundant guard (kept as a cheap regression guard or removed if structurally moot).", "mission_id": "01M1MFVTZGD9KQ6QWYV54ZDBQH", "mission_slug": "metadata-vocab-hub-consolidation-01M1MFVT", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-03T20:41:08.108809Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M1MFXSJHAYEFYCDCC5NKS8JT", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-03T20:41:08.108149Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-09-03T20:41:11.122814+00:00", "event_id": "01M1MG22PJYHJPHE5YMK7FC6MQ", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M1MFXYDCDHXXHW00XK6FJT9Y", "final_answer": "Full lifecycle: the status-aware ADR Hub card surfaces Proposed/Accepted/Superseded/Deprecated status plus date, and orders children by ADR number, so a multi-ADR rendered tree reaches parity with the generated own-tree table.", "mission_id": "01M1MFVTZGD9KQ6QWYV54ZDBQH", "mission_slug": "metadata-vocab-hub-consolidation-01M1MFVT", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-03T20:41:11.122814Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M1MFXYDCDHXXHW00XK6FJT9Y", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-03T20:41:11.122180Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
