{"at": "2026-09-03T22:08:26.907473+00:00", "event_id": "01M1MN1VRVZN7XW3HGN1FJJTKF", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M1MN1VRT868Q6H6Z7DRGKCZ6", "input_key": "consolidation_core_structure", "mission_id": "01M1MFVTZGD9KQ6QWYV54ZDBQH", "mission_slug": "metadata-vocab-hub-consolidation-01M1MFVT", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["Two-layer: fs-free derivation/enum core (metadata.ts imports) + thin fs-loader layer (sections.ts + gate import) \u2014 preserves the fs-free invariant", "Single core incl. fs reads (sections.ts + gate import); metadata.ts imports only pure re-exports \u2014 fewer files, mildly bends the boundary", "Other"], "origin_flow": "plan", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "PLAN", "question": "#49 shared pure-ESM core structure vs metadata.ts's documented fs-free purity boundary \u2014 how to reconcile?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-03T22:08:26.907473Z", "run_id": "01M1MN1VRT868Q6H6Z7DRGKCZ6", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-03T22:08:26.906878Z", "step_id": "plan.consolidation.core-structure"}}
{"at": "2026-09-03T22:26:22.776496+00:00", "event_id": "01M1MP2PDRW8Y2H02X54C5WANF", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M1MN1VRT868Q6H6Z7DRGKCZ6", "final_answer": "Two-layer shared pure-ESM core: (1) a fs-free derivation/enum core (canonical STATUSES/DOC_TYPES/KINDS, frozen SECTION_TYPE fallback, expectedDocType + adr/plans/operations sub-path switch, and the pure vocabulary/axis resolver functions) that metadata.ts and schema.ts import \u2014 preserving metadata.ts's documented fs-free purity contract; (2) a thin fs-loader layer (loadVocabulary, loadSectionRegistry, sectionTypes/sectionSubtypes readers) that reads _meta/*.yaml, imported by sections.ts and the bare-Node validate-frontmatter.mjs gate. Both layers are plain .mjs so the gate imports them directly with no Astro/build context; TS consumers get types via a hand-written .d.ts (no repo-wide allowJs). Codegen rejected: it reintroduces the generated-twin staleness #49 exists to eliminate.", "mission_id": "01M1MFVTZGD9KQ6QWYV54ZDBQH", "mission_slug": "metadata-vocab-hub-consolidation-01M1MFVT", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-03T22:26:22.776496Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M1MN1VRT868Q6H6Z7DRGKCZ6", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-03T22:26:22.775855Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
